ai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498290/extras/d57b58714fb1803b419a02c39dc4c189.avif?t=1686553863\" /></div><br><br>Brought by fate, only some people can follow the blue bird, <br>the envoy, entering the amusement park\u2014Blue Bird Land. <br>Once the risk of losing your soul is accepted, <br>Blue Bird Land will kill someone for you. <br><br>Vivina, a young girl, enters Blue Bird Land with absolute determination,<br>challenging various weird difficulties set by devils. <br>Can she realize her wish, leave Blue Bird Land with her soul, <br>and embrace the new dawn?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498290/extras/a16eb7891eeff57a30428491fb359694.avif?t=1686553863\" /></div><br><br>Hello, I'm Can-Yue (C.moon), a Taiwanese.<br>I set up an independent game studio\u2014Dark Light Studio, <br>and now I\u2019m developing an indie game\u2014Blue Bird Land.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498290/extras/1f7f9c0da1e5ab143093c6fd8eb52ef2.poster.avif?t=1686553863\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498290/extras/1f7f9c0da1e5ab143093c6fd8eb52ef2.webm?t=1686553863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498290/extras/1f7f9c0da1e5ab143093c6fd8eb52ef2.mp4?t=1686553863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>\u3010EP.1\u3011<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498290/extras/0a8949c6f4a246c9efcecc758c7d6c36.avif?t=1686553863\" /></div><br><br>It's bustling with noise and joy; <br>however, Vivina's eye is caught by a different place.<br>It's an opera house, classical, a bit ancient, and pretty quiet.<br><br>The magician's waiting for his prey inside.<br><br>The clowns and puppets are snickering.<br>Facing their deceits and puzzles,<br>Will she succeed? Or she's doomed to be swallowed by shadows?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498290/extras/a9c180dfd148cf2f665ce4e6ee566122.avif?t=1686553863\" /></div><br><br>After passing the challenge of the opera house,<br>Vivina stands in front of a strange mansion.<br>It's dark and a bit shabby.<br><br>She sees shadows of bugs and hears the voice of stretching legs.<br>There are ghosts wandering and whispering eulogy.<br><br>The boy opens the door to invite his guest.<br><br>\u3010EP.2\u3011<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498290/extras/50fcdc01f5cc6372c6d5bf7c02e9a92d.avif?t=1686553863\" /></div><br><br>The young lady sings,<br>sewing her doll.<br>&quot;Come become my doll.&quot;<br>&quot;I will love you.&quot;<br>She smiles.<br>The dolls in Doll House surround Vivina.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498290/extras/15b036ee28c430f478c3bc8988d4e21b.avif?t=1686553863\" /></div><br><br>Vivina believes his &quot;promise&quot;.<br>Once she succeeds in Casino, her soul will be back.<br><br>But will things go as well as she believes?<br>Devils are reveling in Casino.<br>One of them walks towards Vivina with an evil smile.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498290/extras/254f3ef110c9b38a59296c7ffb402a6a.avif?t=1686553863\" /></div><br>\u2605Discord(\uff62\uff65\u03c9\uff65)\uff62<br><br>\u2605Patreon(\uff61\u2022\u3145\u2022\uff61)\u2661<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1498290/extras/9198e